    I ran into an interesting bug the other day.  My character was 
playing around with a bag of tricks and a ring of conflict.  I had
applied the bag of tricks, and created a dust vortex and a cockatrice
next to each other.  The dust vortex tried to swallow the cockatrice
and then regurgitated it.  It tried to swallow it again, and this
time, the cockatrice turned the vortex to stone while still inside the
dust vortex.  At this point, the game crashed.  Oh well..


